{"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"RandomSentence.1","translation":"紫色巨龍和機器人跳舞"},
{"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"RandomSentence.2","translation":"黏糊糊的自助餐在城堡上方說話"},
{"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"RandomSentence.3","translation":"粉白餅乾在行星上方很遠處裂開"},
{"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"RandomSentence.4","translation":"綠色胡椒在乳酪旁邊燒烤"},
{"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"RandomSentence.5","translation":"粗壯雨衣在鞋子旁危險地散發氣味"},
{"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"RandomSentence.6","translation":"巨大潛水艇漂浮在美人魚旁邊，近得令人不舒服"},
{"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"RandomSentence.7","translation":"油膩鬣狗站得離另一隻鬣狗太近"},
{"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"RandomSentence.8","translation":"陰鬱精靈在墳墓上方跳舞"},
{"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"RandomSentence.9","translation":"硬殼般的嘴唇在餅乾上方很遠處裂開"},
{"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"RandomSentence.10","translation":"橡膠般的精靈在災難附近游泳"},
{"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"RandomSentence.11","translation":"勇敢鵪鶉在離另一隻鵪鶉非常非常遠的地方燒烤"},
