{"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"RandomSentence.13","translation":"實用潛水艇在美人魚下方數英里處裂開"},
{"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"RandomSentence.14","translation":"孤獨木偶奔跑到離行星非常非常遠的地方"},
